Hi athoksakis,

This appears to be a common issue and relate to the way more recent R versions evaluate "if (is.null(data) || is.na <http://is.na>(data) || data == "") {". There's a thread on this here https://github.com/CCS-Lab/hBayesDM/issues/153. Hope this helps.

All the best,
